Greetings again, your highness
Every four nights we have an opportunity to venture on the surface in search of new discoveries.
You may choose to take up this opportunity and send out a unit, or to continue past it.
Finding something may inspire your units to do better, but they may only go on one expedition. Discoveries stay with the unit even once upgraded.
That is all. I will be back soon, your highness.
=> END